---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Website & WhatsApp Enquiries"
  description="How Fatima Tour and Travel’s website prepares WhatsApp enquiries, opens phone calls and handles the information you choose to share."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Privacy Policy"
    eyebrow="Your information"
    text="How enquiries work on this website."
    image="goa-coast"
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container privacy-copy">
      <p>Updated 2 November 2026. This notice describes enquiries made through {business.name}’s website.</p>
      <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
      <p>
        The trip enquiry form asks for your name, phone number, service, pickup location and message. You may
        also provide an email address, vehicle preference, travel date, destination and passenger count.
        Optional information can be left blank. Please avoid sharing identity documents, payment details or
        other sensitive information in this form.
      </p>
      <h2>WhatsApp enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Your browser uses the entered details to create a prefilled WhatsApp message, including the source
        page address without query parameters. The website form does not submit enquiries to an email service
        or an enquiry database. Opening WhatsApp does not send the message or confirm a booking: you review
        and send it yourself. When you open the link, WhatsApp receives the prefilled text as part of the
        link, even before you send it.
      </p>
      <p>
        WhatsApp handles the handoff and subsequent conversation under its own{' '}
        <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          privacy policy
        </a>
        . Information you send is used to respond to your travel enquiry and discuss arrangements. Contact us
        about questions concerning the conversation or information you have shared.
      </p>
      <h2>Phone and email contact</h2>
      <p>
        Phone links open your device’s calling functionality. Calls are initiated by you. Our public email,{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>, is a separate contact option; the website’s
        enquiry forms do not send automatic emails.
      </p>
      <h2>Browser storage and hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The website uses a session storage flag to remember whether its introductory animation has appeared in
        the current browser tab. The enquiry form does not deliberately save its fields in browser storage.
        Your browser or device may retain form values or history. The website is hosted on Vercel, which may
        process technical request information such as IP address and browser details to serve and protect the
        site. See{' '}
        <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Vercel’s privacy policy
        </a>
        . No enquiry details are deliberately sent to analytics by the website code.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
      <p>
        Contact {business.name} at <a href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>{business.displayPhone}</a> or{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> with questions or requests about information
        you have shared. Booking terms and any further use of information should be confirmed directly with
        the business.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .privacy-copy {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .privacy-copy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-copy p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-copy a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
